---
title: Bossrush and world tiers
pageSlug: bossrush
modpack: sc-final-adventure
section: gameplay
order: 2
---

SC Final Adventure is built around **discover → progress → conquer → master**.

**Discover.** The overworld, underground, and other dimensions are packed with structures and encounters. Do not race the End on day one — the pack expects you to explore.

**Progress.** Quest chapters, loadout upgrades, and stronger materials gate later content. World-tier scaling keeps late-game gear meaningful; affixes and gems matter as much as raw armor value.

**Conquer.** Escalating bosses include Cataclysm threats and **custom gateway** fights with curated rewards and recipe paths. Treat the gateway bossrush as the true endgame, not a side activity.

**Master.** Enchants, gems, spells, relic-style items, and endgame loops are the long-term grind. Replay value comes from structure placement, the order you take bosses, and which build you commit to.
